  "purpose": "Expose function-scoped evidence coverage and the next SolQvia real-device verification gaps without converting official capability or third-party tests into first-party runtime proof.",
  "principles": [
    "SIM/eSIM recognition is not mobile-data, voice, SMS, OTP, 5G or VoLTE/IMS proof.",
    "APN configuration and eSIM profile provisioning are different layers.",
    "Voice and SMS aggregate results are never expanded into direction-specific outcomes.",
    "Third-party field tests are never relabeled as SolQvia real-device evidence.",
    "Unverified means unknown, not unsupported.",
    "No compatibility score is calculated from mixed evidence classes."
  ],
